<title>GERMANY: Degussa details 95/96 sector results.</title>
<headline>Degussa details 95/96 sector results.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year 1995/1996 ending September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  13,792  vs 13,862</p>
<p>Sales broken down by segment</p>
<p>	Chemical products			  3,846   vs 3,853</p>
<p>	Health and nutrition		     2,698   vs 2,648</p>
<p>	Precious Metals and Banking	    7,248   vs 7,361</p>
<p>	 (thereof precious metals trading)   3,714   vs 3,493</p>
<p>Segmental Income (net operating income</p>
<p>    and interest result of Degussa Bank)     495     vs 481</p>
<p>Income broken down by segment</p>
<p>	Chemical products			    296     vs 262</p>
<p>	Health and Nutrition			 226     vs 189</p>
<p>	Precious Metals and Banking		27(loss)vs 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemical, metal and drugs group is Degussa AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
